<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Mentorship Application Update - Adviso</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8fafc; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #1e293b;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 15px;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <!-- Main Container -->
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
            
            <!-- Header Accent Bar -->
            <tr>
              <td style="height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #64748b, #94a3b8);"></td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Content Area -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 36px 40px;">
                
                <!-- Brand / Logo Area -->
                <div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                  Adviso<span style="color: #4f46e5;">.</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Status Badge -->
                <div style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; background-color: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626;">
                    Application Status Update
                  </span>
                </div>

                <!-- Headline -->
                <h1 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
                  Update on your mentor application
                </h1>
                
                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #475569;">
                  Hi <strong style="color: #0f172a;"><%= name %></strong>, thank you for your interest in joining the Adviso mentor community. We truly appreciate the time and effort you invested in your application.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #475569;">
                  After careful review by our team, we are unable to approve your application to become a mentor at this time.
                </p>

                <!-- Feedback / Reason Box -->
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin: 24px 0; background-color: #fff1f2; border: 1px solid #ffe4e6; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <span style="display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #9f1239; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                        Reviewer Feedback:
                      </span>
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #881337;">
                        <%= reason %>
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #475569;">
                  We regularly welcome re-applications once the noted areas have been addressed or as your experience expands. You are welcome to submit an updated application in the future.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #64748b; text-align: center;">
                  If you have questions regarding this review, feel free to reply directly to this email.
                </p>

              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer Area -->
            <tr>
              <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
                  &copy; 2026 Adviso. All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
                  You received this email because you submitted a mentor application on Adviso.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>